    <statement><p>Starting from the point <m>\left( 4, -1, 4 \right)</m>, reparametrize
 the curve</p>
<p><m>\mathbf{x} (t) = ( 4 + 2t, -1 + 2t, 4 + t )</m> in terms of
 arclength.</p>
<p><m>\mathbf{y}(s) = (</m> <fillin characters="20" name="AnSwEr0001"/>,
 <fillin characters="20" name="AnSwEr0002"/>,<fillin characters="20" name="AnSwEr0003"/> <m>)</m></p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>4+\frac{s\cdot 2}{3}</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>-1+\frac{s\cdot 2}{3}</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>4+\frac{s\cdot 1}{3}</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
